# Frontend

- Query keys only in `src/hooks/queryKeys.ts`.
- Async UI: pending (skeleton) -> error (retry) -> empty -> content.
- Map `error_code` + `request_id` via `mapLeadErrorMessage`.
- Primary: `#00B5D8`. Utility `.bg-blue-20` is `rgba(0, 181, 216, 1)`.
- Do not hardcode hex in JSX. Use semantic tokens (`bg-accent`, `text-foreground`).
